# cellpy workspace — plan documents

The **`cellpy-design-and-development`** repository
(`../cellpy-design-and-development/` from this checkout) is the **authoritative
home for cellpy 2 plan documents** (gap analysis, Stage plans, loader/config/unit
migration plans, etc.). Formerly named `architecture-plan`.

**Do not use `code-reviews/`** for these plans — that location is obsolete.

**Start at** `../cellpy-design-and-development/CURRENT.md`. Layout:

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `CURRENT.md` | Active stage / open plans |
| `PATHS.md` | Old basename → current path |
| `ecosystem/` | Durable architecture primer |
| `roadmap/` | Coordinator + stage issue sets |
| `active/` | Plans still guiding open work |
| `archive/` | Executed topic plans |
| `research/` | Scans / evidence |

When issues or older text reference `code-reviews/cellpy2-*.md`,
`architecture-plan/<basename>.md`, or a flat plan basename, look it up in
`../cellpy-design-and-development/PATHS.md`.

Durable detail: `.issueflows/04-designs-and-guides/cellpy-workspace-repos.md`
